# KoreaGo!

KoreaGo! is a Korean language learning application being developed as a
team project for our Second Language Studies course at the University of
Hawaiʻi at Mānoa.

## Project Goal

Create an engaging and easy-to-use application that helps users learn
and practice Korean.

## Team

- perfectdecalibration — Team Lead / Project Manager, UX/UI Designer
- ryanrankinvt — Lead Developer, UX/UI Designer
- sarahszu — Instructional Designer, Team Lead / Project Manager
- bivensj-dot — Research & Testing Lead, Lead Developer

## Development

This project is currently in development.

## Project Workflow

Tasks are tracked through our GitHub Project board.

